      "arabic_text": "رُوِيَ عَنِ الْعَبْدِ الصَّالِحِ مُوسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِمَا السَّلَامُ قَالَ:",
      "translations": {
        "en": "It is narrated from the righteous servant, Mūsā ibn Jaʿfar عليهما السلام, who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "opening",
      "arabic_text": "«اُدْعُ بِهَذَا الدُّعَاءِ فِي شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ مُسْتَقْبِلَ دُخُولِ السَّنَةِ» وَذَكَرَ «أَنَّ مَنْ دَعَا بِهِ مُحْتَسِبًا مُخْلِصًا لَمْ تُصِبْهُ فِي تِلْكَ السَّنَةِ فِتْنَةٌ وَلَا آفَةٌ فِي دِينِهِ وَدُنْيَاهُ وَبَدَنِهِ وَوَقَاهُ اللَّهُ شَرَّ مَا يَأْتِي بِهِ فِي تِلْكَ السَّنَةِ،",
      "translations": {
        "en": "“Supplicate with this supplication in the month of Ramaḍān, facing the beginning of the year.” And he mentioned: “Whoever supplicates with it, seeking reward and sincerely, no tribulation or affliction will strike him in that year in his religion, his worldly life, or his body, and Allah will protect him from the evil of what that year brings.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ بِاسْمِكَ الَّذِي دَانَ لَهُ كُلُّ شَيْءٍ وَبِرَحْمَتِكَ الَّتِي وَسِعَتْ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ وَبِعِزَّتِكَ الَّتِي قَهَرْتَ بِهَا كُلَّ شَيْءٍ وَبِعَظَمَتِكَ الَّتِي تَوَاضَعَ لَهَا كُلُّ شَيْءٍ وَبِقُوَّتِكَ الَّتِي خَضَعَ لَهَا كُلُّ شَيْءٍ وَبِجَبَرُوتِكَ الَّتِي غَلَبَتْ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ وَبِعِلْمِكَ الَّذِي",
      "translations": {
        "en": "O Allah, I ask You by Your Name to which everything submits, by Your mercy which encompasses everything, by Your might through which You have subdued everything, by Your greatness before which everything has humbled itself, by Your power before which everything has submitted, by Your dominion which has overcome everything, and by Your knowledge by which..."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "«أَحَاطَ بِكُلِّ شَيْءٍ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "“encompassed everything”"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "يَا نُورُ يَا قُدُّوسُ يَا أَوَّلُ قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ وَيَا بَاقِي بَعْدَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ يَا اللَّهُ يَا رَحْمَانُ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تُغَيِّرُ النِّعَمَ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تُنْزِلُ النِّقَمَ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تَقْطَعُ الرَّجَاءَ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تُدِيلُ الْأَعْدَاءَ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تَرُدُّ الدُّعَاءَ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تُنْزِلُ الْبَلَاءَ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّذِي تَحْبِسُ غَيْثَ السَّمَاءِ وَاغْفِرْ لِيَ الذُّنُوبَ الَّتِي تَهْتِكُ الْعِصَمَ وَأَلْبِسْنِي دِرْعَكَ الْحَصِينَةَ الَّتِي لَا تُرَامُ وَعَافِنِي مِنْ شَرِّ مَا أُحَاذِرُ بِاللَّيْلِ وَالنَّهَارِ فِي مُسْتَقْبِلِ سَنَتِي هَذِهِ اللَّهُمَّ رَبَّ السَّمَاوَاتِ السَّبْعِ وَرَبَّ الْأَرَضِينَ السَّبْعِ وَمَا فِيهِنَّ وَمَا بَيْنَهُنَّ وَرَبَّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيمِ وَرَبَّ السَّبْعِ الْمَثَانِي وَالْقُرْآنِ الْعَظِيمِ وَرَبَّ إِسْرَافِيلَ وَمِيكَائِيلَ وَجَبْرَئِيلَ وَرَبَّ مُحَمَّدٍ سَيِّدِ الْمُرْسَلِينَ وَخَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّينَ أَسْأَلُكَ بِكَ وَبِمَا تَسَمَّيْتَ بِهِ يَا عَظِيمُ أَنْتَ الَّذِي تَمُنُّ بِالْعَظِيمِ وَتَدْفَعُ كُلَّ مَحْذُورٍ وَتُعْطِي كُلَّ جَزِيلٍ وَتُضَاعِفُ مِنَ الْحَسَنَاتِ الْكَثِيرِ بِالْقَلِيلِ وَتَفْعَلُ مَا تَشَاءُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "O Light, O Most Holy, O First before everything, and O Everlasting after everything, O Allah, O Most Merciful, send blessings upon Muḥammad and the family of Muḥammad, and forgive me the sins that alter blessings; forgive me the sins that bring down punishments; forgive me the sins that cut off hope; forgive me the sins that give the enemies ascendancy; forgive me the sins that repel supplication; forgive me the sins that bring down affliction; forgive me the sins that withhold the rain of the sky; forgive me the sins that tear away protections. Clothe me in Your fortified armor that cannot be assailed, and grant me well-being from the evil of what I fear by night and day in the coming part of this year. O Allah, Lord of the seven heavens, Lord of the seven earths and what is in them and what is between them, Lord of the Magnificent Throne, Lord of the seven oft-repeated verses and the Magnificent Qur’an, Lord of Isrāfīl, Mīkāʾīl, and Jibrāʾīl, and Lord of Muḥammad, the master of the messengers and the seal of the prophets: I ask You by Yourself and by that with which You have named Yourself. O Magnificent, You are the One who bestows greatly, repels every feared thing, gives every abundant gift, multiplies many good deeds from a little, and does whatever You will."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "يَا قَدِيرُ يَا اللَّهُ يَا رَحْمَانُ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَأَلْبِسْنِي فِي مُسْتَقْبِلِ سَنَتِي هَذِهِ سِتْرَكَ وَأَضِئْ وَجْهِي بِنُورِكَ وَأَحْيِنِي بِمَحَبَّتِكَ وَبَلِّغْ بِي رِضْوَانَكَ وَشَرِيفَ كَرَائِمِكَ وَجَسِيمَ عَطَائِكَ مِنْ خَيْرِ مَا عِنْدَكَ وَمِنْ خَيْرِ مَا أَنْتَ مُعْطِيهِ أَحَدًا مِنْ خَلْقِكَ وَأَلْبِسْنِي مَعَ ذَلِكَ عَافِيَتَكَ يَا مَوْضِعَ كُلِّ شَكْوَى وَشَاهِدَ كُلِّ نَجْوَى وَعَالِمَ كُلِّ خَفِيَّةٍ وَيَا دَافِعَ مَا تَشَاءُ مِنْ بَلِيَّةٍ يَا كَرِيمَ الْعَفْوِ يَا حَسَنَ التَّجَاوُزِ تَوَفَّنِي عَلَى مِلَّةِ إِبْرَاهِيمَ وَفِطْرَتِهِ وَعَلَى دِينِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَسُنَّتِهِ وَعَلَى خَيْرِ الْوَفَاةِ فَتَوَفَّنِي مُوَالِيًا لِأَوْلِيَائِكَ مُعَادِيًا لِأَعْدَائِكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَجَنِّبْنِي فِي هَذِهِ السَّنَةِ كُلَّ عَمَلٍ أَوْ قَوْلٍ أَوْ فِعْلٍ يُبَاعِدُنِي مِنْكَ وَاجْلِبْنِي إِلَى كُلِّ عَمَلٍ أَوْ فِعْلٍ أَوْ قَوْلٍ يُقَرِّبُنِي مِنْكَ فِي هَذِهِ السَّنَةِ يَا أَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ وَامْنَعْنِي مِنْ كُلِّ عَمَلٍ أَوْ فِعْلٍ أَوْ قَوْلٍ يَكُونُ مِنِّي أَخَافُ سُوءَ عَاقِبَتِهِ وَمَقْتَكَ إِيَّايَ عَلَيْهِ حَذَرًا أَنْ تَصْرِفَ وَجْهَكَ الْكَرِيمَ عَنِّي وَأَسْتَوْجِبَ بِهِ نَقْصًا مِنْ حَظٍّ لِي عِنْدَكَ يَا رَءُوفُ يَا رَحِيمُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "O All-Powerful, O Allah, O Most Merciful, send blessings upon Muḥammad and the family of Muḥammad, and clothe me in the coming of this year with Your covering, illuminate my face with Your light, give me life through Your love, and cause me to attain Your good pleasure, the noble of Your honors, and the vastness of Your gift from the best of what is with You and from the best of what You give to any of Your creation. And along with that, clothe me in Your well-being, O place of every complaint, witness of every confidential whisper, knower of every hidden thing, and O repeller of whatever affliction You will. O Generous in pardon, O Beautiful in overlooking, cause me to die upon the creed of Ibrāhīm and his fiṭrah, and upon the religion of Muḥammad and his sunnah (prophetic tradition), and upon the best death. So cause me to die as one loyal to Your friends and hostile to Your enemies. O Allah, keep me away in this year from every deed, statement, or act that distances me from You, and bring me to every deed, act, or statement that draws me near to You in this year, O Most Merciful of the merciful. And prevent me from every deed, act, or statement that may come from me, whose evil outcome I fear and through which I fear Your displeasure toward me, lest You turn Your noble Face away from me and I become deserving by it of a decrease in my portion with You, O Most Kind, O Most Merciful."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "اللَّهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِي فِي مُسْتَقْبِلِ سَنَتِي هَذِهِ فِي حِفْظِكَ وَجِوَارِكَ وَكَنَفِكَ وَجَلِّلْنِي سِتْرَ عَافِيَتِكَ وَهَبْ لِي كَرَامَتَكَ عَزَّ جَارُكَ وَجَلَّ ثَنَاؤُكَ وَلَا إِلَهَ غَيْرُكَ اللَّهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِي تَابِعًا لِصَالِحِي مَنْ مَضَى مِنْ أَوْلِيَائِكَ وَأَلْحِقْنِي بِهِمْ وَاجْعَلْنِي مُسْلِمًا لِمَنْ قَالَ بِالصِّدْقِ عَلَيْكَ مِنْهُمْ وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "O Allah, place me in the coming of this year in Your protection, Your neighborhood, and Your shelter, and envelop me in the covering of Your well-being, and grant me Your honor. Mighty is Your protection, exalted is Your praise, and there is no god but You. O Allah, make me a follower of the righteous among those of Your friends who have passed on, join me with them, make me submissive to those among them who spoke truthfully about You, and I seek refuge in You."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "يَا إِلَهِي أَنْ تُحِيطَ بِي خَطِيئَتِي وَظُلْمِي وَإِسْرَافِي عَلَى نَفْسِي وَاتِّبَاعِي لِهَوَايَ وَاشْتِغَالِي بِشَهَوَاتِي فَيَحُولَ ذَلِكَ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَ رَحْمَتِكَ وَرِضْوَانِكَ فَأَكُونَ مَنْسِيًّا عِنْدَكَ مُتَعَرِّضًا لِسَخَطِكَ وَنَقِمَتِكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَفِّقْنِي لِكُلِّ عَمَلٍ صَالِحٍ تَرْضَى بِهِ عَنِّي وَقَرِّبْنِي إِلَيْكَ زُلْفَى اللَّهُمَّ كَمَا كَفَيْتَ نَبِيَّكَ مُحَمَّدًا صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ هَوْلَ عَدُوِّهِ وَفَرَّجْتَ هَمَّهُ وَكَشَفْتَ كَرْبَهُ وَصَدَقْتَهُ وَعْدَكَ وَأَنْجَزْتَ لَهُ عَهْدَكَ اللَّهُمَّ فَبِذَلِكَ فَاكْفِنِي هَوْلَ هَذِهِ السَّنَةِ وَآفَاتِهَا وَأَسْقَامَهَا وَفِتَنَهَا وَشُرُورَهَا وَأَحْزَانَهَا وَضِيقَ الْمَعَاشِ فِيهَا وَبَلِّغْنِي بِرَحْمَتِكَ كَمَالَ الْعَافِيَةِ بِتَمَامِ دَوَامِ النِّعَمِ عِنْدِي إِلَى مُنْتَهَى أَجَلِي أَسْأَلُكَ سُؤَالَ مَنْ أَسَاءَ وَظَلَمَ وَاسْتَكَانَ وَاعْتَرَفَ أَنْ تَغْفِرَ لِي مَا مَضَى مِنَ الذُّنُوبِ الَّتِي حَضَرَتْهَا حَفَظَتُكَ وَأَحْصَتْهَا كِرَامُ مَلَائِكَتِكَ عَلَيَّ وَأَنْ تَعْصِمَنِيَ اللَّهُمَّ مِنَ الذُّنُوبِ فِيمَا بَقِيَ مِنْ عُمُرِي إِلَى مُنْتَهَى أَجَلِي يَا اللَّهُ يَا رَحْمَانُ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَأَهْلِ بَيْتِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآتِنِي كُلَّ مَا سَأَلْتُكَ وَرَغِبْتُ إِلَيْكَ فِيهِ فَإِنَّكَ أَمَرْتَنِي بِالدُّعَاءِ وَتَكَفَّلْتَ بِالْإِجَابَةِ يَا أَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ ».",
      "translations": {
        "en": "O my God, lest my sin, my wrongdoing, my excess against myself, my following of my desire, and my occupation with my appetites surround me, and that become a barrier between me and Your mercy and Your good pleasure, so that I become forgotten before You and exposed to Your wrath and vengeance. O Allah, grant me success for every righteous deed by which You are pleased with me, and draw me near to You in nearness. O Allah, just as You sufficed Your Prophet Muḥammad—Your blessings be upon him and his family—against the terror of his enemy, relieved his distress, removed his grief, fulfilled to him Your promise, and completed for him Your covenant, then by that, O Allah, suffice me against the terrors of this year, its afflictions, its illnesses, its tribulations, its evils, its sorrows, and the constriction of livelihood within it. Cause me to reach, by Your mercy, complete well-being through the full continuity of blessings with me until the end of my appointed term. I ask You with the asking of one who has done evil, wronged, become humble, and confessed: forgive me for the sins that have passed, which Your watchers attended and Your noble angels counted against me; and protect me, O Allah, from sins in what remains of my life until the end of my appointed term. O Allah, O Most Merciful, send blessings upon Muḥammad and the Ahl al-Bayt of Muḥammad, and give me everything I have asked You for and turned to You desiring, for You have commanded me to supplicate and have guaranteed the answer, O Most Merciful of the merciful.”
      }
    }
